      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    line = sys.stdin.readline().split()\n    N, M = int(line[0]), int(line[1])\n    S = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n    \n    plain = M\n    logo = 0\n    max_logo_needed = 0\n    \n    i = 0\n    while i < N:\n        if S[i] == '0':\n            plain = M\n            i += 1\n            continue\n        start = i\n        while i < N and S[i] != '0':\n            i += 1\n        segment = S[start:i]\n        meals = segment.count('1')\n        contests = segment.count('2')\n        if contests > 0:\n            needed_logo = contests\n            if meals > plain:\n                needed_logo += meals - plain\n            max_logo_needed = max(max_logo_needed, needed_logo)\n        else:\n            if meals > plain:\n                plain = 0\n            else:\n                plain -= meals\n    \n    print(max_logo_needed)\n\nsolve()\n```",
