      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef split_words_by_separator(words, separator):\n    result = []\n    for word in words:\n        # Split the word by the separator and filter out empty strings\n        split_parts = word.split(separator)\n        # Add non-empty parts to the result\n        for part in split_parts:\n            if part:  # Only add if not empty\n                result.append(part)\n    return result\n```",
