 9548 9 10\n3788 174 3088 5950 3 13\n7778 5389 100 9003 10 15\n556 9425 9458 109 3 11\n5725 7937 10 3282 2 9\n6951 7211 8590 1994 15 12\n\nSample Output 3\n\n720358\n77158\n540926\n255168\n969295\nUnreachable\n369586\n466218\n343148\n541289\n42739\n165772\n618082\n16582\n591828",
