ot greater than h_1 = 1. Thus, vertex 2 is guarded.\n- The distance between vertex 3 and vertex p_2 = 5 is 1, which is not greater than h_2 = 2. Thus, vertex 3 is guarded.\n- The distance between vertex 5 and vertex p_1 = 1 is 1, which is not greater than h_1 = 1. Thus, vertex 5 is guarded.\n\nSample Input 2\n\n3 0 1\r\n2 3\n\nSample Output 2\n\n1\r\n2\r\n\nThe given graph may have no edges.\n\nSample Input 3\n\n10 10 2\r\n2 1\r\n5 1\r\n6 1\r\n2 4\r\n2 5\r\n2 10\r\n8 5\r\n8 6\r\n9 6\r\n7 9\r\n3 4\r\n8 2\n\nSample Output 3\n\n7\r\n1 2 3 5 6 8 9",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef solve():\n    # Read input\n    N, M, K = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n    \n    # Build graph\n    graph = [[] for _ in range(N + 1)]\n    for _ in range(M):\n        a, b = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n        graph[a].append(b)\n        graph[b].append(a)\n    \n    # Read guards\n    guards = []\n    for _ in range(K):\n        p, h = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n        guards.append((p, h))\n    \n    # Find all guarded vertices using BFS from each guard\n    guarded = set()\n    \n    for start_vertex, stamina in guards:\n        # BFS to find all vertices within distance <= stamina\n        visited = [False] * (N + 1)\n        queue = deque([(start_vertex, 0)])  # (vertex, distance)\n        visited[start_vertex] = True\n        \n        while queue:\n            vertex, dist = queue.popleft()\n            \n            # Mark as guarded if within stamina\n            if dist <= stamina:\n                guarded.add(vertex)\n            else:\n                continue  # No need to explore further from this node\n            \n            # Explore neighbors\n            for neighbor in graph[vertex]:\n                if not visited[neighbor]:\n                    visited[neighbor] = True\n                    queue.append((neighbor, dist + 1))\n    \n    # Sort guarded vertices\n    result = sorted(list(guarded))\n    \n    # Output\n    print(len(result))\n    if result:\n        print(' '.join(map(str, result)))\n    else:\n        print()\n\nsolve()\n```",
