      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    N = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    grid = [['' for _ in range(N)] for _ in range(N)]\n    \n    center = N // 2\n    grid[center][center] = 'T'\n    \n    # Directions: right, down, left, up\n    dx = [0, 1, 0, -1]\n    dy = [1, 0, -1, 0]\n    \n    x, y = 0, 0\n    direction = 0\n    num = 1\n    \n    for _ in range(N * N - 1):\n        if x == center and y == center:\n            # Skip center\n            x -= dx[direction]\n            y -= dy[direction]\n            direction = (direction + 1) % 4\n            x += dx[direction]\n            y += dy[direction]\n        \n        grid[x][y] = str(num)\n        num += 1\n        \n        nx, ny = x + dx[direction], y + dy[direction]\n        if nx < 0 or nx >= N or ny < 0 or ny >= N or grid[nx][ny] != '':\n            direction = (direction + 1) % 4\n            nx, ny = x + dx[direction], y + dy[direction]\n        \n        x, y = nx, ny\n    \n    for row in grid:\n        print(' '.join(row))\n\nsolve()\n```",
