      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef max_gold(n, offers):\n    offers.sort(key=lambda x: x[1])\n    dp = [0] * (n + 1)\n    \n    for start, end, gold in offers:\n        # Binary search for the latest non-overlapping offer\n        left, right = 0, len(offers) - 1\n        best_idx = -1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if offers[mid][1] < start:\n                best_idx = mid\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        \n        prev_dp = dp[best_idx + 1] if best_idx != -1 else dp[0]\n        dp[end + 1] = max(dp[end + 1], prev_dp + gold)\n        \n    return max(dp)\n```",
