      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef canMakeEqualZero(nums, k):\n    n = len(nums)\n    diff = [0] * (n + 1)\n    operations = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        operations += diff[i]\n        current = nums[i] - operations\n        if current < 0:\n            return False\n        if current > 0:\n            if i + k > n:\n                return False\n            diff[i] += current\n            diff[i + k] -= current\n            operations += current\n    return True\n```",
