      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    N = int(data[0])\n    T = int(data[1])\n    \n    # Initialize scores for N players (index 1 to N)\n    scores = [0] * (N + 1)  # scores[i] is the score of player i\n    index = 2\n    \n    for _ in range(T):\n        A = int(data[index])\n        B = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        \n        # Update the score of player A\n        scores[A] += B\n        \n        # Count distinct score values (excluding index 0)\n        distinct_scores = len(set(scores[1:]))\n        \n        print(distinct_scores)\n\nsolve()\n```",
