      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    chords = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        a, b = int(data[1 + 2*i]), int(data[2 + 2*i])\n        if a > b:\n            a, b = b, a\n        chords.append((a, b))\n    \n    # Sort by left endpoint\n    chords.sort()\n    \n    # Use a stack to check intersections\n    stack = []\n    for a, b in chords:\n        while stack and stack[-1] < a:\n            stack.pop()\n        if stack and stack[-1] < b:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n            return\n        stack.append(b)\n    \n    print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
