    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom math import isqrt\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    A = list(map(int, data[1:1+n]))\n    \n    def normalize(x):\n        if x == 0:\n            return 0\n        res = 1\n        d = 2\n        while d * d <= x:\n            cnt = 0\n            while x % d == 0:\n                x //= d\n                cnt += 1\n            if cnt % 2 == 1:\n                res *= d\n            d += 1\n        if x > 1:\n            res *= x\n        return res\n    \n    count = {}\n    for a in A:\n        key = normalize(a)\n        count[key] = count.get(key, 0) + 1\n    \n    ans = 0\n    for v in count.values():\n        ans += v * (v - 1) // 2\n    \n    print(ans)\n\nsolve()\n```",
