      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxSum(nums, m, k):\n    n = len(nums)\n    if k > n:\n        return 0\n    \n    window_sum = sum(nums[:k])\n    freq = {}\n    for num in nums[:k]:\n        freq[num] = freq.get(num, 0) + 1\n    max_sum = window_sum if len(freq) >= m else 0\n    \n    for i in range(k, n):\n        # Add new element\n        new_num = nums[i]\n        freq[new_num] = freq.get(new_num, 0) + 1\n        \n        # Remove old element\n        old_num = nums[i - k]\n        freq[old_num] -= 1\n        if freq[old_num] == 0:\n            del freq[old_num]\n        \n        window_sum += new_num - old_num\n        \n        if len(freq) >= m:\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, window_sum)\n    \n    return max_sum\n```",
