      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef max_palindrome_length():\n    s = input().strip()\n    n = len(s)\n    max_len = 1\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        # Odd length palindromes\n        l, r = i, i\n        while l >= 0 and r < n and s[l] == s[r]:\n            max_len = max(max_len, r - l + 1)\n            l -= 1\n            r += 1\n        \n        # Even length palindromes\n        l, r = i, i + 1\n        while l >= 0 and r < n and s[l] == s[r]:\n            max_len = max(max_len, r - l + 1)\n            l -= 1\n            r += 1\n    \n    print(max_len)\n\nmax_palindrome_length()\n```",
