      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    m = int(data[1])\n    s = list(data[2])\n    colors = list(map(int, data[3:3+n]))\n    \n    # Group indices by color\n    color_indices = {i: [] for i in range(1, m+1)}\n    for idx, c in enumerate(colors):\n        color_indices[c].append(idx)\n    \n    # Process each color from 1 to m\n    for color in range(1, m+1):\n        indices = color_indices[color]\n        if len(indices) == 0:\n            continue\n        # Get characters at these indices\n        chars = [s[i] for i in indices]\n        # Right circular shift by 1: last becomes first\n        shifted_chars = [chars[-1]] + chars[:-1]\n        # Update s\n        for i, idx in enumerate(indices):\n            s[idx] = shifted_chars[i]\n    \n    print(''.join(s))\n\nsolve()\n```",
