      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxDistance(nums):\n    def is_prime(n):\n        if n < 2:\n            return False\n        if n == 2:\n            return True\n        if n % 2 == 0:\n            return False\n        for i in range(3, int(n**0.5) + 1, 2):\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n    \n    first_prime_idx = -1\n    last_prime_idx = -1\n    \n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        if is_prime(num):\n            if first_prime_idx == -1:\n                first_prime_idx = i\n            last_prime_idx = i\n    \n    return last_prime_idx - first_prime_idx\n```",
