      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solution(nums, queries):\n    n = len(nums)\n    marked = [False] * n\n    total_sum = sum(nums)\n    marked_sum = 0\n    \n    # Create list of (value, index) for sorting\n    indexed_nums = [(nums[i], i) for i in range(n)]\n    indexed_nums.sort()\n    \n    # Pointer to track next smallest unmarked element\n    ptr = 0\n    \n    result = []\n    \n    for index, k in queries:\n        # Mark the element at index if not already marked\n        if not marked[index]:\n            marked[index] = True\n            marked_sum += nums[index]\n        \n        # Mark k smallest unmarked elements\n        while k > 0 and ptr < n:\n            val, idx = indexed_nums[ptr]\n            if not marked[idx]:\n                marked[idx] = True\n                marked_sum += val\n                k -= 1\n            ptr += 1\n        \n        result.append(total_sum - marked_sum)\n    \n    return result\n```",
