      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countInterestingSubarrays(nums, modulo, k):\n    from collections import defaultdict\n    \n    prefix_count = defaultdict(int)\n    prefix_count[0] = 1\n    current = 0\n    result = 0\n    \n    for num in nums:\n        # Check if current element satisfies the condition nums[i] % modulo == k\n        if (num % modulo) == k:\n            current += 1\n        \n        # Compute current modulo value\n        current_mod = current % modulo\n        \n        # Required previous prefix mod value to form a valid subarray\n        target = (current_mod - k) % modulo\n        \n        # Add count of previous prefixes that satisfy condition\n        result += prefix_count[target]\n        \n        # Update prefix count for current_mod\n        prefix_count[current_mod] += 1\n    \n    return result\n```",
