      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumSubarraySum(nums, k):\n    n = len(nums)\n    prefix = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for i in range(n):\n        prefix[i + 1] = prefix[i] + nums[i]\n    \n    max_sum = float('-inf')\n    seen = {}\n    \n    for j in range(n):\n        val = nums[j]\n        # Check for nums[i] = val + k\n        if val + k in seen:\n            i = seen[val + k]\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, prefix[j + 1] - prefix[i])\n        # Check for nums[i] = val - k\n        if val - k in seen:\n            i = seen[val - k]\n            max_sum = max(max_sum, prefix[j + 1] - prefix[i])\n        \n        # Store earliest index for each value\n        if val not in seen:\n            seen[val] = j\n    \n    return max_sum if max_sum != float('-inf') else 0\n```",
