      "generated_answer": "Using Bayes' theorem:  \nP(D|TP) = [P(TP|D) × P(D)] / [P(TP|D) × P(D) + P(TP|¬D) × P(¬D)]  \n= (0.99 × 0.05) / (0.99 × 0.05 + 0.03 × 0.95)  \n= 0.0495 / (0.0495 + 0.0285) = 0.0495 / 0.078 ≈ 0.635  \n\nThus, the correct answer is F.  \n\n\\boxed{F}",
