    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "We compute updated RTTs and RTTD after each RTTM using:\n\n\\[\n\\text{RTTs} \\leftarrow (1-\\alpha) \\cdot \\text{RTTs} + \\alpha \\cdot \\text{RTTM}\n\\]\n\\[\n\\text{Err} = \\text{RTTM} - \\text{RTTs}\n\\]\n\\[\n\\text{RTTD} \\leftarrow (1-\\beta) \\cdot \\text{RTTD} + \\beta \\cdot |\\text{Err}|\n\\]\n\nGiven initial RTTs = 70 ms, RTTD = 10 ms, \\(\\alpha = 0.15\\), \\(\\beta = 0.2\\):\n\nIterating through the six RTTM samples yields final  \nRTTs ≈ 56.26 ms, RTTD ≈ 13.52 ms.  \n\\[\n\\text{RTO} = \\text{RTTs} + 4 \\times \\text{RTTD} \\approx 56.26 + 4 \\times 13.52 \\approx 110.34\\ \\text{ms}\n\\]\n\nClosest option is 110.22 ms (H).  \n\n\\boxed{H}",
