    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion:  When the analyst reads the data from a critical perspective to determine whether or not this fits with their expectations, this constitutes what is termed a:\n\nOptions: \nA. Control group.\nB. Confirmation bias.\nC. Content validity.\nD. Face validity.\nE. Observational bias.\nF. Criterion validity.\nG. Experimental group.\nH. Focus group.\nI. Construct validity.\nJ. Reliability.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
