      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{G} The likelihood ratio test statistic for comparing VAR(6) to VAR(4) is computed as \\( T \\times (\\ln|\\Sigma_4| - \\ln|\\Sigma_6|) \\), where \\( T = 250 \\). Using the determinants, \\( \\ln(0.0049) - \\ln(0.0036) \\approx 0.3083 \\), yielding \\( 250 \\times 0.3083 \\approx 77.07 \\).",
