    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: the average salary of all the workers in a workshop is rs . 8000 . the average salary of 9 technicians is rs . 18000 and the average salary of the rest is rs . 6000 . the total number of workers in the workshop is :\n\nOptions: \nA. 22\nB. 54\nC. 88\nD. 37\nE. 29\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Let the total number of workers be $ x $.  \nTotal salary of all workers = $ 8000x $  \nSalary of 9 technicians = $ 9 \\times 18000 = 162000 $  \nSalary of the rest $ (x - 9) $ workers = $ (x - 9) \\times 6000 $  \n\nSetting up the equation:  \n$ 162000 + 6000(x - 9) = 8000x $  \n$ 162000 + 6000x - 54000 = 8000x $  \n$ 108000 = 2000x $ → $ x = 54 $\n\n\\boxed{B}",
