    "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Alfvén's  (all-VANE's)  theorem uses the idealized form of this law to prove that magnetic field lines exactly coincide with the streamlines in a plasma.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
